 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Dog. Woof woof. The friendly dog says woof woof.",
  "file": "bv_0954c72e"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Cat. Meow meow. The soft little cat says meow.",
  "file": "bv_fc0dce68"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Cow. Moo moo. The big cow says moo.",
  "file": "bv_309cf5ed"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Lion. Roar roar. The brave lion says roar.",
  "file": "bv_a5e582eb"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Monkey. Oo oo aa aa. The funny monkey jumps and calls.",
  "file": "bv_c6f596b0"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Horse. Neigh neigh. The happy horse says neigh.",
  "file": "bv_9d8d63a8"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Sheep. Baa baa. The fluffy sheep says baa.",
  "file": "bv_0d0c903c"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Duck. Quack quack. The duck swims and says quack.",
  "file": "bv_07383113"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Bird. Tweet tweet. The little bird sings tweet tweet.",
  "file": "bv_6e611061"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Elephant. Pawoo pawoo. The gentle elephant makes a trumpet sound.",
  "file": "bv_8e23a4b8"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "The kind bunny found one carrot. A hungry friend came by. Bunny smiled and shared the carrot. Both friends felt happy and full.",
  "file": "bv_e776e8c2"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "A little fish was scared to swim far. Then it saw a tiny bubble path. The fish followed slowly and found a beautiful coral garden.",
  "file": "bv_37ca5ba0"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Mina opened a blue book. The pictures became bright and friendly. She learned letters, numbers, colors, and a happy song.",
  "file": "bv_f89e73ae"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Panda saw toys on the floor. He picked them up one by one. The room became clean, and everyone clapped for helpful Panda.",
  "file": "bv_a9ed9b63"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "The children packed red apples, yellow bananas, and green grapes. After rain, a rainbow appeared. They named every color together.",
  "file": "bv_b6632524"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Starry sky, soft and bright. Little dreams glow through the night. Close your eyes and smile with me. Happy hearts are wild and free.",
  "file": "bv_baabdabd"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Apple red, apple sweet. Crunchy fruit is good to eat. One small bite and one big grin. Healthy habits now begin.",
  "file": "bv_f89f2df2"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Little bunny hops around. Tiny feet tap on the ground. Hop hop here and hop hop there. Bunny dances everywhere.",
  "file": "bv_d5695202"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Red and yellow, green and blue. Rainbow colors smile at you. Point and name them one by one. Learning colors is such fun.",
  "file": "bv_6d11e277"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "One step, two step, three and four. Tiny feet go to the door. Five steps, six steps, clap with me. Counting makes us bright and free.",
  "file": "bv_683f5443"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Good morning sun, hello new day. Wash your face and start to play. Read a book and sing along. Morning time is bright and strong.",
  "file": "bv_24c1b288"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Tiny fish in water blue. Swims around and waves to you. Bubble bubble, splash and glide. Happy fish goes side to side.",
  "file": "bv_b10478be"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Busy bee goes buzz buzz buzz. Flying gently just because. Flower here and flower there. Sweet little bee is in the air.",
  "file": "bv_bc4b6ef5"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Sleepy moon is shining high. Soft white clouds are drifting by. Teddy waits beside the bed. Sweet dreams dance inside your head.",
  "file": "bv_3c6c3ee7"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Carrot orange, leafy green. Freshest garden ever seen. Water plants and watch them grow. Healthy foods help children glow.",
  "file": "bv_4b7e3c38"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Friendly dog says woof woof woof. Wagging tail and tiny hoof. Run and fetch and sit down too. Doggy loves to play with you.",
  "file": "bv_99b463a3"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Open book and turn the page. Stories sparkle on the stage. Words can fly and pictures sing. Reading is a magic thing.",
  "file": "bv_17975a76"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Circle rolls and square stands still. Triangle climbs a tiny hill. Star shines bright and heart says hi. Shapes are dancing in the sky.",
  "file": "bv_9a37b47b"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Raindrops tap on window glass. Little clouds are moving past. Boots go splash and umbrellas sway. We can smile on rainy day.",
  "file": "bv_5ba560a4"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Flower smiles in morning light. Petals soft and colors bright. Bees come near and butterflies play. Garden friends say hello today.",
  "file": "bv_8ce984fe"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Little train goes choo choo choo. Rolling past the hills so blue. Stop and wave, then start again. Learning rides the happy train.",
  "file": "bv_3ca24eea"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Wash your hands with bubbly foam. Clean and fresh before you roam. Rub and rinse and dry them too. Healthy hands are good for you.",
  "file": "bv_e575830d"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Kind words make a sunny day. Please and thank you light the way. Share a toy and help a friend. Happy hearts will never end.",
  "file": "bv_3bd4be00"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Little bird sings tweet tweet tweet. Perched upon a branch so neat. Flap your wings and fly up high. Music floats across the sky.",
  "file": "bv_d7a47596"
 },
 {
  "group": "listen",
  "text": "Good night toys and good night light. Good night moon so soft and bright. Close your eyes and rest your head. Dreams are waiting near your bed.",
  "file": "bv_18809536"
 },
